// REQUIRES: long
// P04.04 (manager decision M3): the second half of core-linear.long.test: the
// fan-in, the switches, the struct fields and the keyed literals at N = 10000
// and 4N (4N at most 8 times as long), then the long chain and the two rings.
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 fanin 10000
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 switch 10000
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 fields 10000
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 keyed 10000
// A chain three times longer than the one that overflowed the checker's
// stack in the normal build (16000) is checked without a crash.
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label core-linear-2 --out %t.chain.lin1 --n 64000 --gen "%S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py initchain {n}" -- %gopp check -check-j=1 {file}
// A ring of constants of 20000 links, and a ring of 32000 variables, are
// reported once, without a crash. The three are timed by
// Inputs/check-linear.py (N/16 and N, at most 48 times the CPU time).
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label core-linear-2-2 --out %t.cring.lin2 --n 20000 --gen "%S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py constcycle {n}" --status 1 --output %t.cring.lin2.out -- %gopp check -check-j=1 {file}
// RUN: cat %t.cring.lin2.out | FileCheck --check-prefix=CONST %s
// CONST: error[E0142]: initialization cycle for c0
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label core-linear-2-3 --out %t.ring.lin3 --n 32000 --gen "%S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py cycle {n}" --status 1 --output %t.ring.lin3.out -- %gopp check -check-j=1 {file}
// RUN: cat %t.ring.lin3.out | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: error[E0142]: initialization cycle for v0
